 "tangi bertin", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@tangib?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/2-people-walking-on-pathway-between-bare-trees-during-foggy-weather-reLB6gIk7to?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(140, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(178, 46%, 48%)", "label": "TECH", "seed": "3d04ad25edfd"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-02", "word_count": 82, "reading_minutes": 0.3, "lead": "サウジアラビアの大きい石油会社アラムコが、国のAI会社HUMAINの株を買います。お金は約99億リヤルです。", "lead_zh": "沙特阿拉伯的大型石油公司阿美将买下本国AI公司HUMAIN的股份，金额约99亿里亚尔。", "preview": "HUMAINはAIを作る新しい会社です。今までは国の基金PIFが全部持っていました。", "preview_zh": "HUMAIN是一家做AI的新公司，此前由国家基金PIF全资持有。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 830, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/85/ja_n5.mp3", "duration": 22.75, "size_bytes": 136224, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "jf_alpha", "word_count": 62, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@60dc809/content/data/versions/846.json"}], "ja_n4": [{"content_hash": "6c48211b82dc5332", "version_id": 847, "article_id": 85, "level_code": "ja_n4", "lang": "ja", "level": 2, "level_label": "N4 初級", "title": "サウジアラビアの石油大手がAI企業HUMAINの49%を買収", "title_zh": "沙特石油巨头收购AI公司HUMAIN 49%股份", "has_translation": true, "topic": "tech", "source": "ithome", "source_url": "https://www.ithome.com/1/020/863.htm", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1580163059128-129fad4b73fb?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8N3x8aHVtYWlufGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTM1ODExNDh8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by tangi bertin on Unsplash", "author": "tangi bertin", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@tangib?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/2-people-walking-on-pathway-between-bare-trees-during-foggy-weather-reLB6gIk7to?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(140, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(178, 46%, 48%)", "label": "TECH", "seed": "3d04ad25edfd"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-02", "word_count": 121, "reading_minutes": 0.5, "lead": "サウジアラビアの石油大手サウジアラムコは、国のAI企業HUMAINの49%の株を買います。残りの51%は国の基金PIFが持ちます。", "lead_zh": "沙特石油巨头沙特阿美将收购本国AI企业HUMAIN 49%的股份，剩下的51%由主权基金PIF持有。", "preview": "HUMAINは11月1日、この話を発表しました。これまでHUMAINは、サウジアラビアの国の基金PIFが100%持っていました。買収のあとは、PIFが51%、アラムコが49%を持ちます。", "preview_zh": "HUMAIN于11月1日宣布了这一消息。此前HUMAIN由沙特主权基金PIF全资持有。收购后PIF持股51%，阿美持股49%。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 831, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/85/ja_n4.mp3", "duration": 30.675, "size_bytes": 188064, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "jf_alpha", "word_count": 89, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@60dc809/content/data/versions/847.json"}], "ja_n3": [{"content_hash": "a2873276ecd1e973", "version_id": 848, "article_id": 85, "level_code": "ja_n3", "lang": "ja", "level": 3, "level_label": "N3 中級", "title": "サウジアラムコ、AI企業HUMAINの49%株を取得へ", "title_zh": "石油巨头沙特阿美将收购AI企业HUMAIN 49%股份", "has_translation": true, "topic": "tech", "source": "ithome", "source_url": "https://www.ithome.com/1/020/863.htm", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1580163059128-129fad4b73fb?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8N3x8aHVtYWlufGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTM1ODExNDh8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by tangi bertin on Unsplash", "author": "tangi bertin", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@tangib?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/2-people-walking-on-pathway-between-bare-trees-during-foggy-weather-reLB6gIk7to?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(140, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(178, 46%, 48%)", "label": "TECH", "seed": "3d04ad25edfd"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-02", "word_count": 207, "reading_minutes": 0.7, "lead": "サウジアラビアの国営石油会社サウジアラムコが、同国のAI新興企業HUMAINの株式49%を取得することになりました。国の基金PIFは残りの51%を持ち続けます。石油からAIへ、国の力の入れ方が見えてきます。", "lead_zh": "沙特国有石油公司沙特阿美将收购本国AI初创企业HUMAIN 49%的股份，国家基金PIF继续持有剩余51%。从石油转向AI，可以看出国家投入重心的变化。", "preview": "HUMAINは今月1日、この取引を発表しました。これまでHUMAINはサウジアラビアの政府系基金PIFがすべての株を持っていました。今回の取引でアラムコが49%を持ち、PIFは51%を残すので、会社の主導権は国の側に残ります。", "preview_zh": "HUMAIN于本月1日宣布了这笔交易。此前HUMAIN的全部股份由沙特政府基金PIF持有。此次交易后阿美持有49%，PIF保留51%，因此公司主导权仍留在国家一方。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 832, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/85/ja_n3.mp3", "duration": 43.45, "size_bytes": 264960, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "jf_alpha", "word_count": 143, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@60dc809/content/data/versions/848.json"}], "ja_n2": [{"content_hash": "32fd4a894b9a01ac", "version_id": 849, "article_id": 85, "level_code": "ja_n2", "lang": "ja", "level": 4, "level_label": "N2 中高級", "title": "サウジアラビアの石油大手Aramco、AI企業HUMAINの49%株を取得へ", "title_zh": "石油巨头沙特阿美将收购AI企业HUMAIN 49%股份", "has_translation": true, "topic": "tech", "source": "ithome", "source_url": "https://www.ithome.com/1/020/863.htm", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1580163059128-129fad4b73fb?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8N3x8aHVtYWlufGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTM1ODExNDh8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by tangi bertin on Unsplash", "author": "tangi bertin", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@tangib?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/2-people-walking-on-pathway-between-bare-trees-during-foggy-weather-reLB6gIk7to?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(140, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(178, 46%, 48%)", "label": "TECH", "seed": "3d04ad25edfd"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-02", "word_count": 221, "reading_minutes": 0.8, "lead": "サウジアラビアの国営石油大手Aramcoは、同国の人工知能（AI）新興企業HUMAINの株式49%を取得する方針を明らかにした。HUMAINはこれまで同国政府系ファンドのPIFが全株を保有していたが、今回の取引でPIFが残り51%を保持する形となる。", "lead_zh": "沙特国有石油巨头沙特阿美宣布，将收购本国人工智能初创企业HUMAIN 49%的股份。HUMAIN此前由该国主权财富基金PIF全资持有，此次交易后PIF将保留剩余51%的股份。", "preview": "HUMAINは現地時間1日、Aramcoが同社の株式49%を取得すると発表した。Aramcoは重要なAI資産の譲渡に加え、約99億サウジアラビア・リヤルを出資する計画である。これにより、HUMAINはPIFが51%、Aramcoが49%を保有する合弁に近い体制へと移行することにな", "preview_zh": "HUMAIN于当地时间1日宣布，Aramco将收购该公司49%的股份。Aramco计划在转让关键AI资产的同时，出资约99亿沙特里亚尔。由此，HUMAIN将转变为PIF持股51%、Aramco持股49%的准合资体制。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 833, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/85/ja_n2.mp3", "duration": 44.95, "size_bytes": 334944, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "jf_alpha", "word_count": 96, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@60dc809/content/data/versions/849.json"}], "ja_n1": [{"content_hash": "d2bd1af1dc7d41ea", "version_id": 850, "article_id": 85, "level_code": "ja_n1", "lang": "ja", "level": 5, "level_label": "N1 上級", "title": "サウジアラビアの石油大手アラムコ、AI新興企業HUMAINの49%株を取得へ", "title_zh": "沙特石油巨头阿美将收购AI初创公司HUMAIN 49%股份", "has_translation": true, "topic": "tech", "source": "ithome", "source_url": "https://www.ithome.com/1/020/863.htm", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1580163059128-129fad4b73fb?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8N3x8aHVtYWlufGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTM1ODExNDh8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by tangi bertin on Unsplash", "author": "tangi bertin", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@tangib?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/2-people-walking-on-pathway-between-bare-trees-during-foggy-weather-reLB6gIk7to?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(140, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(178, 46%, 48%)", "label": "TECH", "seed": "3d04ad25edfd"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-02", "word_count": 288, "reading_minutes": 0.9, "lead": "サウジアラビアの国営石油大手サウジアラムコが、同国主权财富基金PIFが全額出資する人工知能新興企業HUMAINの株式49%を取得する。アラムコは自社の産業基盤にAI能力を融合させ、事業全体の高度化を図る狙いだ。", "lead_zh": "沙特国有石油巨头沙特阿美将收购该国主权财富基金PIF全资持有的人工智能初创企业HUMAIN 49%的股份。阿美计划将AI能力融入自身产业基础，推动整体业务升级。", "preview": "サウジアラビアの主权财富基金PIFが全額出資する人工知能新興企業HUMAINは現地時間1日、世界的な石油化学大手サウジアラムコが同社株式の49%を取得すると発表した。残る51%は引き続きPIFが保有し、経営の主導権はPIF側に残る形となる。発表によれば、アラムコは重要度の高いAI", "preview_zh": "由沙特主权财富基金PIF全资持股的人工智能初创企业HUMAIN于当地时间1日宣布，全球石化巨头沙特阿美将收购该公司49%的股份。剩余51%仍由PIF持有，经营权仍掌握在PIF一方。根据公告，阿美计划转让关键AI资产，并注资约99亿沙特里亚尔。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 824, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/85/ja_n1.mp3", "duration": 22.4, "size_bytes": 363600, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "jf_alpha", "word_count": 95, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@60dc809/content/data/versions/850.json"}]}}}